WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:02.940
Operational security, or OPSEC, isn't

2
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.739
just a policy, it's a daily

3
00:00:04.739 --> 00:00:07.610
responsibility. Even small pieces of

4
00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:09.499
information, when combined, can

5
00:00:09.499 --> 00:00:11.777
reveal critical details about missions,

6
00:00:11.777 --> 00:00:13.777
personnel, or timelines. A single

7
